  "source_selection": "First same20 broad-bank engine/class sources used by prior numerical smoke, plus first5 distinct unrendered training hashes for each of four exact Piper continuation texts. Fixed before any occurrence-model inference. Continuation cohort is Piper-only; differences across cohorts cannot establish a causal context effect.",
  "observation": "Metadata inspection before this plan found all training positive estimated endpoints above335 frames (minimum411). Missing full-history startup alone cannot explain this training geometry. No raw held-out source array or new held-out score was read for that inspection.",
  "recurrence": "Sum probability over all CTC paths whose collapsed sequence contains adjacent distinct tokens[hey1,nyx2]. Blank0 and repeated symbols obey CTC collapse; arbitrary symbols may precede/follow the match. Three log states: no pending hey, suffix hey, absorbing match. This retains out-of-grammar competition inside the match and does not renormalize a four-choice vocabulary.",
  "measurement": "Record complete scalar/logit/exact/occurrence traces and original smoothed endpoint accounting. Report all maxima and greedy sequences at the scalar peak, fixed.97 views and a neutral67-step six-class prior. No threshold/window/gain selection or advancement decision.",
  "limits": "Optimization-seen training sources, small deterministic diagnostic cohorts and correlated renderer/text exposure. Recurrence is an event probability, not calibrated wake confidence; chance occurrence can grow with window length. Piper-only continuation is confounded with engine/voice/wording. Source text is synthesis intent, not pronunciation truth. No fitting, new export, score-scale tuning, validation/test inference, audio/source-WAV access, playback, microphone, board, production device, PCM speed or audio producer changes. This cannot qualify an inference rule or establish Hi ESP recall, FAR, latency, resources or voice stability."
}
